<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1314" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀδιά-πτωτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>infallible</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Decent.</u>
				12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				7.110
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρχὴ ἀ. τῇ πόλει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PRyl.</u>
					77.46
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					6.26.4
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Stoic.</u>
				3.69
			</span></i>; <i>unerringly</i>, of archers, <i><span class="en">
				Hld.
				9.18
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>faultless</i>, of writers, <i><span class="en">
				Longin.
				33.5
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἀ.</span>
			<i>perfection</i> of style, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				36.4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φράσις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Diog.Bab.Stoic.
					3.214
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προφορά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.T.
					629.12
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> Gramm., <i>not
				using cases at random</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Pron.</u>
				109.23
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>uninflected</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				643.47
			</span></i>.</div>
